On September 2, 2026, the Board of Directors of the Company (the &#8220;Board&#8221;) of Albemarle Corporation (the &#8220;Company&#8221;) approved a leadership succession
        plan for the Company by appointing Ragnar Udd to succeed J. Kent Masters, Jr. as the Company&#8217;s President and Chief Executive Officer, effective as of February 1, 2027 or a mutually agreed earlier date (the &#8220;CEO Employment Commencement Date&#8221;).&#160;
        Effective as of the CEO Employment Commencement Date, Mr. Masters will transition to the role of Executive Chair of the Board.
